    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Brain and Mind Institute's (BMI) Brain Health Research team hosted its Joint Planning and Strategy Retreat in Nyahururu, Kenya, from August 20-22, 2025. Held under the theme Advancing Brain Health Together, the retreat brought together researchers and Community Advisory Board members to review progress, refine strategies and build stronger collaborations for the future of brain health in Kenya and beyond.",
